WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:15.000
Start with the official FWS land-exchange assessment and maps.
The documented area is in Cameron County. A proposal is not a completed purchase.

00:15.000 --> 00:30.000
Run the free Python company-name lookup for Space Exploration.
It exports CSV and JSON with retrieval time and source information.

00:30.000 --> 00:45.000
The live query returned eight name matches; five were exported.
Not all similarly named businesses are affiliates. Mailing ZIP is not parcel location.

00:45.000 --> 01:00.000
Continue manually in Cameron Appraisal District and County Clerk records.
Download the free demo and worksheet at c4573.org. The full kit costs $13.37 once.
